9:["$","p","25",{"className":"text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["Premium voice cloning is genuinely good. In a test with an English tech review, the Czech dubbed version preserved the speaker's tone and pacing. Background music stayed clean throughout."]}]
