d:["$","p","33",{"className":"text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["For the price point, TubeVoice delivers solid value. The three-tier system lets you match quality to budget. If you regularly watch foreign YouTube content and subtitles frustrate you, this is worth trying."]}]
